 "text": "No oscillator: Noise through a filter, opened briefly by a short envelope, makes drums. The Clock retriggers them. A band-pass is a snare's crack; a high-pass a hi-hat. Try: the filter's CUTOFF and RESONANCE (high resonance on noise rings like a tom); the envelope's DECAY; move the clock cable from 1/8 to 1/16; plug the SVF's other outputs in.",
